5,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I am Midori. I hope we can find the truth together.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi! I'm Rin. This looks like a fun adventure. Let's start!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hey! I'm Sakura. I love mysteries! Who is the wolf?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,Shion here. I'll observe. Let's see who blinks first.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,Greetings. I am Benjamin. Logic will guide us through the fog.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with Benjamin. Logic is key. Let's listen carefully to each other.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! I want to try new things. Who wants to be my friend?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm curious about Shion. You seem very quiet. Are you hiding something?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Hiding? No. Just waiting. Your curiosity is loud, Sakura.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Quiet observation is often more valuable than loud speculation. Let's proceed.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,I appreciate the calm approach. Let's keep the discussion respectful and focused.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,I think we should all be nice! But also find the bad guy. Right?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to prank someone later! Just kidding. Or am I? Hehe.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,Your jokes are predictable. I prefer precision. Let's focus on the game.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Humor is fine, but let's not let it obscure the facts. Stay sharp.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Midori,,"I will do my best to help the village. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,Good night! I hope I don't get eaten. That would be scary!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Good night! I'll be watching you all. Especially you, Shion!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shion,,Good night. I'll be watching too. Don't make mistakes.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,Good evening. May reason prevail over chaos. Rest well.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
